   573→## State of the Art
   574→
   575→| Old Approach | Current Approach | When Changed | Impact |
   576→|--------------|------------------|--------------|--------|
   577→| jQuery DOM manipulation | Vanilla JS with cached refs | 2020-2024 | Smaller bundle, native performance, no deps |
   578→| Inline styles | CSS classes + transitions | 2023+ | GPU acceleration, respects prefers-reduced-motion |
   579→| Tables for layout | CSS Grid | 2017+ | Responsive without media query complexity |
   580→| setInterval for animation | requestAnimationFrame | 2015+ | 60fps sync with browser paint cycle |
   581→| Manual ARIA | Semantic HTML + native elements | 2021+ | Better screen reader support out-of-box |
   582→| Sass/LESS variables | CSS custom properties | 2020+ | Runtime theming, no build step |
   583→
   584→**Deprecated/outdated:**
   585→- &lt;table&gt; for layout: Use CSS Grid for two-dimensional layouts
   586→- innerHTML for updates: Use textContent for text-only updates (XSS prevention)
   587→- DocumentFragment performance claims: MDN 2026 notes performance benefit "often overstated" - optimize for readability
   588→- offsetWidth/Height for measurements: Use ResizeObserver API for async, non-blocking measurement
