   602→3. **Performance threshold for 32 register updates?**
   603→   - What we know: Only changed registers need updates (typically 1-3 per cycle)
   604→   - What's unclear: Actual performance on low-end devices
   605→   - Recommendation: Implement selective updates; measure with Chrome DevTools on throttled CPU
